# What git keeps but the semantic index should not carry: generated output and
# desktop build artefacts. `.gitignore` already covers target/ and node_modules/.
#
# `docs/` is deliberately absent from this list. It no longer holds workshop
# notebooks — those live in Sailor's own store now — and the six pages left are
# each opened by name by something that runs, so an index that finds them finds
# the thing the code is written against.

target/
desktop/node_modules/
desktop/dist/
desktop/src-tauri/target/
*.lock
Cargo.lock
desktop/package-lock.json

